## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's DiceExtension|r 1.4.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Extends the chat window's Random Roll. The game's own /roll is fixed at one die of 100 from the chat screen's Random Roll keybind; this remembers how many dice you want and how many sides they have -- up to 10 dice of up to 1000 sides -- rolls them from /pbdice, from R3 in the chat screen, or from the settings panel, and shows every die and the total. Optionally puts the matching /roll command in the chat box so the game itself rolls it and your group sees it.
## Version: 1.4.1
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsDiceExtension_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Dice.lua
Keybind.lua
Prefill.lua
Settings.lua

